However, the research of the cult of the Sinai and 
Raithou monks at St. Catherines Monastery has not even 
come close to exhausting all available textual testimonies. Al- 
though admittedly scarce and sometimes unintelligible, they 
do provide a useful basis for understanding this problem. 

First and foremost, the key testimonies are found in 
